      "side": 1,
      "message": "This commit mainly fixes the null deref bug introduced by 9f98621. About wether to return wcc_data on failures, according to RFC1813 Section 3.1:\n\n\"Implementors are strongly encouraged to return as much attribute data as possible upon failure, but client implementors need to be aware that their implementation must correctly handle the variant return instance where no attributes or consistency data is returned.\"\n\nSo wcc_data should be returned on failure, thought it is not required. \n\nThe patch has been updated to return wcc on failure. \n\nThanks!",
      "parentUuid": "f91760a6_ebafecf9",
